sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Recruiter
    participant W as web container
    participant A as api container
    participant DB as postgres as app_admin
    participant F as uploads volume
    participant O as Ollama via the bridge

    R->>W: GET /admin/login
    R->>W: POST /api/admin/login
    W->>A: POST /admin/login
    A->>DB: lockout check, then a row in admin_sessions
    A-->>R: Set-Cookie admin_session for 12 hours
    R->>W: GET /admin
    Note over W: page redirects to /admin/jobs
    R->>W: GET /api/admin/jobs
    Note over W,A: Cookie is forwarded. No cookie is HTTP 401.
    W->>A: GET /admin/jobs
    A->>DB: jobs and crawl_state
    A-->>R: open and closed postings
    R->>W: POST /api/admin/jobs/recrawl
    A->>A: fetch janus-soft.com from this container
    A->>O: structure each new description
    A->>DB: upsert jobs and job_chunks
    R->>W: POST /api/admin/resumes with the file
    A->>F: store the original by SHA-256
    A->>O: JSON profile from redacted text
    A->>DB: candidate, status pending_review
    R->>W: POST /api/admin/resumes/{id}/confirm
    A->>DB: embeddings, then match rows
    A->>O: short explanation stored on the match
    R->>W: GET /api/admin/review?code and candidate
    Note over A,DB: Line coverage is Python. This call does not use the model.
    A->>DB: job text and résumé text
    A-->>R: matched lines and missing lines
